        },
        {
          "text": "azini Matania’i, Mataniani Mika mvi’i, Mikani Zabidi mvi’i, Zabidini Asafu adripi ’ba dri cepi awa’difo ’yozu Mungu ziza ma aliari ma mvi’i, azini Bakibukia ’ba iriru adripi erini ’diyi ma eseliari’i; azini Abida’i, Abidani Samua mvi’i, Samuani Galali mvi’i, Galalini Yedutuni mvi’i. ",
