          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benyamini anziyi ovu vini Gebaa, Mikimasi pie, Aija pie, Beteli pie, aku erini ’diyi pie, ",
